  "name": "EFC vs ΛCDM: Complete Kill-Test — From Rotation Curves to Planck: A Consistent Low-Dimensional Alternative",
  "headline": "Six-probe kill-test of Energy-Flow Cosmology against ΛCDM with four cobaya minimize runs all returning Δχ² ≤ 0 in the EFC direction",
